1
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:31,780
Needle drops and brass ignites.

2
00:00:31,829 --> 00:00:33,500
Green silk flashes in the lights.

3
00:00:33,579 --> 00:00:35,960
One, two, take the floor.

4
00:00:36,020 --> 00:00:37,939
No more thinking anymore.

5
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:40,579
Feet fly across the oak.

6
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:43,049
All the heavy chains are broke.

7
00:00:43,119 --> 00:00:45,439
Scatter chassés cut the air.

8
00:00:45,579 --> 00:00:52,920
Lifting up without a care.

9
00:00:53,100 --> 00:00:55,119
Other dancers step aside.

10
00:00:55,299 --> 00:00:57,420
Caught within our racing tide.

11
00:00:57,600 --> 00:00:59,820
Her hand locked into my spine.

12
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:02,119
Every syncopation fine.

13
00:01:02,299 --> 00:01:04,689
Roaring inside my chest.

14
00:01:04,819 --> 00:01:07,230
Putting all my fears to rest.

15
00:01:07,290 --> 00:01:09,549
Turn and hover, sharp and bold.

16
00:01:09,599 --> 00:01:17,390
Turning motion into gold.

17
00:01:22,170 --> 00:01:25,120
Mara watches from the wall.

18
00:01:25,299 --> 00:01:27,719
Mary silent in the hall.

19
00:01:27,780 --> 00:01:29,909
Pendulum swing in the bend.

20
00:01:30,019 --> 00:01:34,409
Rushing blindly to the end.

21
00:01:43,840 --> 00:01:47,700
Final lockstep, sudden freeze.

22
00:01:48,629 --> 00:01:53,010
No more trembling in my knees.

23
00:01:53,450 --> 00:01:58,510
Silence where the thunder stood.

24
00:01:58,859 --> 00:02:05,579
Breath and sweat upon the wood.